# Harshav — Development Journal

**Project:** NurseSync  
**Contribution area:** Prescription processing, discharge support, and application infrastructure

## Week 1 — Backend setup and data model

Set up the FastAPI backend structure, configuration, and clinical data model used by the application. This established the common foundation for routes, services, and the frontend API client.

## Week 2 — Prescription scanning

Developed the prescription-scanning workflow and its backend route. The feature takes a prescription image through the application flow and presents extracted information for the nurse to review.

## Week 3 — Discharge-summary experience

Implemented the discharge-summary view to present a structured summary for patient transition. The screen is designed to make essential information easy to review before discharge.

## Week 4 — Navigation and shared state

Integrated the application router, shared state context, API client, and response mappers. This gave each feature a consistent way to load and exchange clinical information.

## Week 5 — UI consistency and testing support

Refined the common visual system and connected the remaining prescription and patient-data interfaces. Reviewed the integration between frontend views and backend endpoints to ensure a coherent application experience.

